{
  "title": "DynamoDB · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "키 기반 접근에 적합한 관리형 서버리스 NoSQL DB다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>DynamoDB</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#tables-items-and-attributes\">Tables, Items and Attributes</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key and Sort Key</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#query-and-scan\">Query and Scan</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-secondary-index\">Global Secondary Index</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#local-secondary-index\">Local Secondary Index</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#on-demand-and-provisioned-capacity\">On-Demand and Provisioned Capacity</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#read-consistency\">Read Consistency</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#transactions-and-conditional-writes\">Transactions and Conditional Writes</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\">DynamoDB Streams and TTL</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-tables\">Global Tables</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-accelerator\">DynamoDB Accelerator</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#backup-pitr-and-export\">Backup, PITR and Export</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>데이터베이스</span><span>12 / 62</span></div><h1>DynamoDB</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 12 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>DynamoDB는 Key-value·Document 접근을 위한 관리형 NoSQL Database다. Schema 설계는 먼저 어떤 Key로 어떤 범위의 Item을 조회할지 정하는 Access Pattern에서 시작한다.</p><p>관계형 Join을 그대로 옮기기보다 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key</a> 분산, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Sort Key</a>, Index와 Transaction 범위를 설계한다. 관리형 확장도 Hot Partition이나 비효율적인 Scan을 자동으로 없애 주지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"접근 패턴과 Index\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>접근 패턴과 Index</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Primary access</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>User ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span> + Time</strong><small>자주 조회하는 조건</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key</a> + <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Sort Key</a></strong><small>분산·범위 조회 모델</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Query</strong><small>필요 Item 접근</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Alternative access</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Different lookup key</strong><small>다른 조회 패턴</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-secondary-index\">GSI</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#local-secondary-index\">LSI</a></strong><small>지원 Key·Consistency 선택</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Index Query</strong><small>Storage·Capacity 비용 고려</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Filter가 Scan으로 읽은 데이터의 Capacity 비용을 없애 주지는 않는다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"tables-items-and-attributes\"><h2>Tables, Items and Attributes<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#tables-items-and-attributes\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Table은 Item 집합이고 Item은 Attribute로 구성된다. Primary Key 외 Attribute 구조는 유연하지만 Item 크기·API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 제한은 존재한다. Document를 저장한다고 모든 Attribute 검색이 효율적인 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"partition-key-and-sort-key\"><h2>Partition Key and Sort Key<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key</a>는 데이터 분산·접근의 기준이다. Composite Primary Key는 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key</a> 안에서 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Sort Key</a>로 Item을 구분·범위 조회한다. 소수 Key에 트래픽이 몰리면 전체 용량이 충분해도 Hot Partition이 생길 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"query-and-scan\"><h2>Query and Scan<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#query-and-scan\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Query는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key</a>와 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Sort Key</a> 조건으로 필요한 Item을 찾는다. Scan은 Table·Index 전체를 읽으며 Filter가 Read 비용을 미리 없애 주지는 않는다. 빈번한 Scan 요구는 Key·Index 모델을 다시 검토할 신호다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"global-secondary-index\"><h2>Global Secondary Index<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-secondary-index\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-secondary-index\">GSI</a>는 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Sort Key</a>의 조회 경로를 제공한다. Table 생성 뒤 추가할 수 있고 별도 Capacity·Storage 비용을 고려한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-secondary-index\">GSI</a> 읽기는 Strongly Consistent Read를 지원하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"local-secondary-index\"><h2>Local Secondary Index<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#local-secondary-index\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#local-secondary-index\">LSI</a>는 같은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key</a>에 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Sort Key</a>를 제공하며 Table 생성 때 정의한다. Strongly Consistent Read를 지원하지만 Item Collection 크기 등 제약이 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-secondary-index\">GSI</a>와 생성 시점·Capacity·Consistency가 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"on-demand-and-provisioned-capacity\"><h2>On-Demand and Provisioned Capacity<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#on-demand-and-provisioned-capacity\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\">On-Demand</a>는 요청 기반 과금과 가변 트래픽에 적합하고 Provisioned는 Read·Write Capacity를 설정한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">Auto Scaling</a>은 Provisioned Capacity를 정책에 따라 조정한다. 급격한 변화·Hot Key·계정 한도를 함께 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"read-consistency\"><h2>Read Consistency<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#read-consistency\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>기본 Eventually Consistent Read와 지원 Table·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#local-secondary-index\">LSI</a>의 Strongly Consistent Read를 구분한다. Strong Read는 더 많은 Read Capacity를 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-secondary-index\">GSI</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-tables\">Global Table</a>의 Consistency는 별도 지원 조건을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"transactions-and-conditional-writes\"><h2>Transactions and Conditional Writes<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#transactions-and-conditional-writes\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Transaction API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>는 여러 Item의 원자적 변경을 지원한다. Conditional Write는 예상 Version·상태 조건이 맞을 때만 변경해 중복·경쟁을 제어한다. Transaction의 항목 수·크기·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 범위를 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\"><h2>DynamoDB Streams and TTL <span class=\"full-name\">(Time to Live)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Streams는 Item 변경 기록을 제공해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> 등 후속 처리를 연결한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-streams-and-ttl\">TTL</a>은 만료 Item을 비동기 삭제하므로 정확한 초 단위 삭제 Timer가 아니다. 만료 데이터 노출을 막아야 하면 앱 조회 조건도 적용한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"global-tables\"><h2>Global Tables<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-tables\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>의 Replica Table을 관리한다. 현재 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-tables\">MREC</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-tables\">MRSC</a> Consistency Mode가 있으며 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>·Topology·기능이 다르다. 모든 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-tables\">Global Table</a>이 항상 Eventual이라고 단정하지 않고 생성 시 선택한 Mode를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"dynamodb-accelerator\"><h2>DynamoDB Accelerator<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-accelerator\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#dynamodb-accelerator\">DAX</a>는 호환 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>로 읽기 지연을 줄이는 관리형 In-memory Cache다. Microsecond급 Cache Read가 필요한 Workload에 비교한다. Strong Read·Transaction 등은 Cache 경로와 지원 조건을 확인하며 Write Capacity를 대신하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"backup-pitr-and-export\"><h2>Backup, PITR <span class=\"full-name\">(Point-in-Time Recovery)</span> and Export<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#backup-pitr-and-export\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\">On-demand</a> Backup과 지원 보존 기간의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#backups-pitr-and-cloning\">PITR</a>을 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Export로 분석용 Copy를 만들 수 있다. Restore는 새 Table을 만드는 방식이며 Index·접근 설정·앱 전환도 검증한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>사용자별 주문 목록은 User ID <span class=\"full-name\">(Identifier)</span>를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Partition Key</a>, 주문 시각을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#partition-key-and-sort-key\">Sort Key</a>로 설계한다. 전체 Table Scan 대신 다른 조회 패턴에 맞는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/#global-secondary-index\">GSI</a>를 추가한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>복잡한 조인·기존 SQL 트랜잭션을 그대로 옮길 관계형 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>의 동의어가 아니다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/developerguide/Introduction.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">amazondynamodb/latest/developerguide/Introduction.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/amazondynamodb/latest/developerguide/GlobalTables.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">amazondynamodb/latest/developerguide/GlobalTables.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q058/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q058\" data-question=\"Q058\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q058</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q058/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A key-value lookup service has unpredictable request volume and must scale without server management. Which is a primary candidate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q058\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">FSx for Lustre</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q058\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">DynamoDB on-demand capacity</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q058\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only local SQLite on one EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q058\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS sc1</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/\">DynamoDB</a> 온디맨드는 키 기반 접근과 변동 워크로드에 적합하다. 데이터 모델은 접근 패턴에 맞춰야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/\">DynamoDB</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q059\" data-question=\"Q059\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q059</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q059/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application frequently looks up customers by customer ID, but its DynamoDB partition key was chosen arbitrarily. What should be improved first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q059\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The S3 Glacier storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q059\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The number of NAT gateways</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q059\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The key and index design based on access patterns</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q059\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The AMI version</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/\">DynamoDB</a>는 테이블 키와 인덱스를 주요 질의 패턴에 맞춰 설계해야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dynamo/\">DynamoDB</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q054\" data-question=\"Q054\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q054</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q054/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can the standby instance of a standard RDS Multi-AZ DB instance deployment serve read queries?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Every standby is readable</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The standby in this deployment type is for failover</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if Route 53 is used</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the network ACL is opened</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스의 standby는 읽기 요청을 처리하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 클러스터와 구분한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q055\" data-question=\"Q055\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q055</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q055/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS database has increasing read traffic, and the application can tolerate some replication lag. Which option most directly scales reads?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An additional security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a Multi-AZ DB instance standby</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>가 읽기 요청을 나눈다. 보통 비동기 복제 지연을 고려한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q087\" data-question=\"Q087\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,4\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q087</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q087/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to improve both availability and read throughput for an existing RDS DB instance. Which TWO options address these goals?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A single Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스는 장애 조치, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>는 읽기 확장에 맞춘다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">이전 용어 <b>DataSync / Snow Family</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">다음 용어 <b>EBS</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
